v3.0 (2026-10-31)
-----------------
* add check for group or world-writable executable files
* add check for suid or sgid executable files
* add check for missing/deleted executable files
* add check for /proc/<pid>/cmdline not matching /proc/<pid>/comm
* remove mdwx:hard, as causes issues on some systems. Switch to plain mdwx.



v2.0 (2026-06-19)
-----------------
* show session leader processes in bold
* add 'threads' count for displayed processes
* display limits applied to max pids, max memory, max files and max file size using either rlimit or cgroups.
* add command-line selections to display servers, processes that can escalate privilidge, processes with memory issues or processes with remote connections open
* display more info (process user and thread count) on wider terminals




v1.0 (2026-06-12)
-----------------
* initial release
